{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_67470ca9488f473d98a00d11","type":"tool_result","content":"893\t(defn replay-artifacts\n894\t  \"The cc4 portable replay corpus. All admission coordinates and naming inputs\n895\t   are supplied data. Kept public so the separately declared budget runner can\n896\t   retain exactly the artifacts whose digests the equality gate checks.\"\n897\t  ([] (replay-artifacts true))\n898\t  ([annotated?]\n899\t   (let [prepare (if annotated? identity\n900\t                     #(walk/postwalk (fn [n]\n901\t                                       (if (map? n)\n902\t                                         (dissoc n :yang/call-site) n)) %))\n903\t         forms '[(defn replay\n904\t                   [x]\n905\t                   (let [[a b] [x 1.5]]\n906\t                     (+ (identity ^:replay a) (identity ^:replay a) b)))\n907\t                 (replay 2)]\n908\t         projected (fn [id ast token]\n909\t                     (let [ast (prepare ast)\n910\t                           p (encoder/project\n911\t                               (encoder/source-envelope :cc4/replay token [ast]))]\n912\t                       {:id id :compiled ast :tree (first (:yin/batch p))\n913\t                        :rows (:yin/frontend-metadata p)}))\n914\t         ast (yang/compile-program forms)\n915\t         macro-ast (yang/compile-program\n916\t                     '[(defmacro twin\n917\t                         [x]\n918\t                         (yin/if (yin/literal true) x\n919\t                                 (yin/application (yin/variable 'f) [(yin/literal 1)])))\n920\t                       (defn f\n921\t                         [x]\n922\t                         x) (twin (f 1))])\n923\t         expansion (:result (expand-like-the-repl (prepare macro-ast)))\n924\t         store (mem/create-content-mem)\n925\t         call-spec (update (call/module-spec publish-registry) :ast prepare)\n926\t         call-result (pu